# Optional. Tailscale auth key for the rig's three nodes.
#
# Set it (uncomment below) to have the three nodes join your real tailnet
# and find each other there. Leave it unset/commented to run the rig with
# no tailnet at all: the nodes then find each other via LAN broadcast
# discovery over this compose file's own Docker network instead — no
# tailscale account needed, just `docker compose up -d --build`.
#
# Admin console > Settings > Keys > Generate auth key
#   Reusable:  yes (three containers share it)
#   Ephemeral: yes (nodes disappear from the tailnet when you stop the compose stack)
#   Tags:      optional, but set one here if your ACL requires it
# TS_AUTHKEY=tskey-auth-xxxxxxxxxxxx
